   #125[6]        | Async SHM multi-server path is non-functional                                   | bug             
   #126[7]        | Mutex held across await in async multi-client send_to_connection                | enhancement     
   #127[8]        | Standalone async one-way latency measurement includes executor scheduling delay | bug             
   #128[9]        | Transport config parity: async vs blocking runners use different defaults       | enhancement     
   #129[10]       | Server process exit status not checked after wait()                             | bug             
   #130[11]       | Deduplicate logging setup and implement init_logging                            | enhancement     
   #131[12]       | pthread_mutex_init/condattr_init return values unchecked in SHM-direct          | bug             
                                                                                                                      
